          }
        ],
        "text": "The wedding of writer Pandiyan, son of Punyakodi, foreman at Sivasakthi Mills, Singanallur, and Miss Bama of Coimbatore merchant Gunaratnam, will be celebrated grandly at the bride's residence. You and your family....",
        "notes": [
          "The source invitation breaks off after `தங்கள் சுற்றமும்`; the English preserves that incompleteness.",
          "The source identifies Punyakodi as Pandiyan's father but does not explicitly print a daughter-relationship word between merchant Gunaratnam and Bama, so the English does not add one."
        ]
